    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i get that, but i also hear a lot of people in my neighborhood saying that moving toward more density is going to ruin the vibe of the area and mess with property values. is there a valid reason for people to want to keep single-family zoning, or is that just people being difficult?",
